id: pm-rl-7073
title: Enforce kernel CPU and storage quotas for Compose trainers
description: "The shared process contract validates trainer-reported CPU milliseconds and polls observed wall/storage use. Compose supplies filesystem and process isolation, but hard CPU-time and disk quotas remain a separate scheduler capability. Add measured kernel-enforced limits without changing the reservation and receipt schema."
